    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "预读补丁在高并发下耗尽本地缓冲区",
      "summary": "Feike Steenbergen 报告，effective_io_concurrency 大于等于 64 时，ReadStream 的预读会把本地缓冲区吃光，PG19 生产实例在高峰每小时触发数十次。Melanie Plageman 确认把本地缓冲区预算限制在四分之一的提交应回合到 PG18，是否回合 PG17 还在评估。补丁到位前，可以调高 temp_buffers 或调低 effective_io_concurrency 缓解。",
      "url": "https://www.postgresql.org/message-id/CAK_s-G3-KZ=Q91U-SikX6aNrcGmv_CUjQS5ZH-rDOwmEZ=Dn-Q@mail.gmail.com",
      "author": "Melanie Plageman",
      "source": "PostgreSQL hackers",
      "source_date": "2026-07-23",
      "image": "",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "预读",
        "缓冲区",
        "缺陷"
      ],
      "position": 1
